  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations University Centre for Policy Research (UNU-CPR)&#x2019;s Managing Exits from Armed Conflict (MEAC) initiative is a multi-year collaboration to develop, and pilot test, a unified, rigorous approach to examining how and why individuals exit armed conflict and evaluating the efficacy of interventions meant to help support their transition to civilian life.</narrative>
